+`xmodel/k16-t2-gate-gpt55-20260903.run.v2` by pairing the
+`charged_input_<i>_sha256=` and `charged_input_<i>_basename=` lines.  All nine
+frozen inputs verified `OK`.  Manifest artifact:
+
+```text
+ca2168656e0c5f57f1980752809702abc57d94a4e90b9eb40c81bc909dfd13c4  box/k16t2-gate-20260903/charged_input_manifest.sha256
+```
+
+MEASURED.  `which Singular` is `/usr/bin/Singular`; `Singular -v` reports
+Singular 4.3.2, Debian `1:4.3.2-p10+ds-1.1build1`.
+
+No ledger files, `jc2-lean`, ideation files, or in-progress lane reports were
