+
+## CAS Replay
+
+MEASURED.  Regenerating the charged program from the frozen generator by
+
+```text
+python3 /tmp/jc2-lane.atRkSn/inputs/t2_order_system.py --gauged --emit-singular
+```
+
+gave the charged program exactly:
+
+```text
+6234d5ffa0a4f278eed2940062abedac749cf63c7d8326e0dad927401227414d  box/k16t2-gate-20260903/t2_order_system_gauged.sing
+7315 bytes
