+Theorem-1.2 two-disc order chart after the stated safe normalizations.  This
+confirms `SATURATED-EMPTY` for the normalized necessary superset and therefore
+for the target `(28,20; M2'=25; V2'=3; J=c gamma)` component, assuming the
+charged descended-data-to-chart route.  It is not a uniform-in-`t` certificate
+and not a statement about arbitrary `(28,20; J=c gamma)` support outside this
+forced chart.
